# AI Assistant Instructions

## Context & Preparation
* Always read and analyze the entire document/file context before writing code or suggesting changes.
* Ensure you understand the surrounding architecture before modifying a specific function.

## Commenting & Documentation
* NO unnecessary comments. Do not explain obvious code or basic syntax.
* Only comment on highly complex logic where the "why" is not immediately obvious from reading the code.

## Code Style
* Write clean, concise, and production-ready code.
* Avoid overly verbose explanations in your chat responses; get straight to the code.